\b Optional Step\b0 . You may have noticed that the planets themselves don't rotate around their own axis. Easy solution. Add the Rotator Script to each Planet (Object) in the inspector. Then drag the planet itself onto the Mesh Object in the Geosynchronous Master Rotator File Of The Universe Script. Set values in the script and there you go. Everthing Rotate!\par
Play around and switch up and mix the values. And remember, this script works well with any Object that need the power of Rotation!\par
This should get you going. Send a mail if you have any more questions or need assistance with something. \par
